      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albany%2C_Kentucky",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Albany sits at 960 feet on the western edge of the Cumberland Plateau, overlooking the nearby Albany Rock peak at 1,700 feet.",
